posts.body:
When opening Ten_core, pressing F4 cannot make the game be fullscreen. What's more, the loading screen didn't stop when I open Ten_cssloaders and press F4.
I have made small changes to your plugin as shown below, but that may not cause that problem.
Code:
Graphics._paintUpperCanvas=function(){
    this._clearUpperCanvas();
    if(this._loadingImage&&this._loadingCount>=5)Ten_cssLoaders.show();
   };
   Graphics.endLoading = function() {
    this._clearUpperCanvas();
    this._upperCanvas.style.opacity = 0;
    Ten_cssLoaders.hide();
   };
Well, I think I solved the second problem in someway, by adding this._loadingCount=0 to the endLoading funtion.

